      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ness_Ziona"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1905, Michael Halperin unfurled a blue‑white flag emblazoned with a Star of David and the words “Ness Ziona.”.",
