        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ness_Ziona"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Within Nes Ziona’s limits lies the ruined Arab village of Sarafand al‑Kharab, depopulated in 1948.",
